    "createdAt": 1780284262382,
    "text": "## Summary\n\n### Glob Results\n\n**Source `.ts` files** (excluding `node_modules`) span three areas:\n\n| Location | Count |\n|---|---|\n| `sources/**/*.ts` | 100+ files across ~15 directories |\n| `*.ts` (root) | 5 files (`index.ts`, `playwright.config.ts`, `vitest.config.ts`, `expo-env.d.ts`, `nativewind-env.d.ts`) |\n| `e2e/**/*.ts` | 1 file (`smoke.test.ts`) |\n\nKey source directories: `auth/`, `components/`, `changelog/`, `sync/`, `hooks/`, `encryption/`, `realtime/`, `modal/`, `text/`, `utils/`, `constants/`, `scripts/`, `dev/`, `app/`.\n\n### Main Component Files\n\n- **`index.ts`** — Minimal entry point; imports Unistyles and hands off to Expo Router.\n- **`TaskListView.tsx`** — React Native component rendering a task timeline with animated status dots. Uses `React.memo`, Unistyles `StyleSheet.create`, and typed props (`TaskItem[]`). Supports three statuses: `pending`, `in_progress` (pulsing yellow), `completed` (green + strikethrough). Each task gets a parent row with title and a child row with `childLabel()` text.\n- **`clusterTimeline.ts`** — Pure function `computeMessageClusters()` that consolidates `TaskCreate`/`TaskUpdate` tool-call messages into a single `TaskClusterMessage` timeline card. Handles edge cases: early `TaskUpdate` before `TaskCreate` (buffered + replayed), cross-turn task resolution (numeric fallback + external `taskIdMap`), and absorbing orphaned tool calls before the first `TaskCreate`.\n\n### Git State\n\nCurrent branch `wip/device-debug-cache` has modified `TaskListView.tsx`, `clusterTimeline.ts`, `package.json`, and `yarn.lock`, plus untracked `e2e/` and `playwright.config.ts` (Playwright E2E setup in progress).",
